{"sourceUrl":"https://emba.hit.edu.cn/info/1042/3988.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.439196+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://emba.hit.edu.cn/info/1042/3988.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强全国大学生对哈尔滨工业大学</span></span><span>商</span><span><span>学院的了解，</span></span><span>商</span><span><span>学院将于</span>2026<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月举办</span><span>“</span><span>暑期学术交流营</span><span>”</span><span>活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><span>申请资格</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格，有志于从事工商管理类科学研究</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>优选来自</span><span>“双一流”建设高校或所在学科为“双一流”建设学科的高水平大学学生，或者本科前</span><span>3</span><span>年（或前</span><span>5</span><span>学期）学科专业综合成绩排名前</span><span>10%</span><span>的学生</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）英语水平优良，具备一定的</span><span>英语</span><span>阅读、翻译及写作能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>二</span><span>、申请流程</span></p>\n<p><span>1、申请形式：</span></p>\n<p><span>扫描报名信息二维码</span><span>（</span><span>见附件一</span><span>）</span><span>填写相关信息提交报名。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、报名时间：</span><span>即日起</span><span><span>至</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>15</span></span><span>日。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>、申请材料：　</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩排名证明原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）体现英语水平的证明材料（国家英语四六级成绩，</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩，</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>，</span><span>IELTS</span></span><span>成绩</span><span>等）。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）其他证明材料，包括但不限于：已发表论文中代表性论文</span><span>1</span><span>篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>注：请申请人将以上材料扫描后整合为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，邮件主题和文件命名为“姓名</span><span>+</span><span>毕业院校”，发送至邮箱</span></span></strong><strong><span>cy_sxy@hit.edu.cn</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>、确定名单：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院根据申请者的网上报名信息，重点考察申请者学业水平、科研能力和综合素质，确定入营者名单。名单将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span><span>日前通过</span></span><span>邮件、电话的形式通知。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>入选者请准备以下材料进行资格复审：个人有效身份证件</span><span>,</span><span>申请材料的</span><span>1-3</span><span>（原件），以上材料原件在入营报到时审核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三</span><span>、活动安排</span></p>\n<p><span>1、报到时间</span><span>：拟定于</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span>日</span><span>下午</span><span>报到</span></p>\n<p><span>2、报到地点</span><span>：另行通知</span></p>\n<p><span>3、活动内容</span><span>（</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>19</span><span>日</span></span><span>）</span><span>：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）开营式，</span></span><span>学院介绍，</span><span>师生交流会；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）聆听专家学术报告</span><span>，</span><span>受邀</span><span>参与</span><span>第二</span><span><span>届</span><span>“气候领导力国际会议”，</span></span><span>感受</span><span>高水平国际学术会议氛围</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）</span><span>参观校园、博物馆、航天馆等；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）</span><span>学术交流及其他活动。</span></p>\n<p><span>注：具体日程安排可能根据实际情况调整</span></p>\n<p><span>四</span><span>、其他说明</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、学院将为营员提供</span></span><span>学术交流</span><span>营期间的保险、食宿、参观、学术</span><span>交流</span><span>等费用。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span>、学员报到后需全程参加</span><span>学术交流</span><span>活动。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>、具体政策以当年学校相关文件为准。</span></p>\n<p><span>五</span><span>、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>    <span>联系人：崔老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>15754516274</span></span></p>\n<p><span>电子邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:cy_sxy@hit.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>cy</span></span></span><span><span>_sxy@hit.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>商学院</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span></span><br/></p>\n<p><span><span><span>附件</span><span>1：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://emba.hit.edu.cn/__local/A/C0/00/09D8A21669E2CBA875B37B5E392_A37E8FB4_21F2E.png\"/></p>\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>","textSha256":"266302e4698c3e1404f36b9f3a81c908657270f6749976787183738fa2443899","textLength":1041,"sourceSha256":"5fe23a8198bb4a71f92c3a509afc3eaceed07649146ba70064297e5760fe48b6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3533040f4294c0ddac83","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学商学院2026年暑期学术交流营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.439196+00:00"}
